# Copy this file to ".env" and paste in your key to enable the live Google map.
# Without a key, Lexee automatically uses its built-in stylized map instead.
#
# How to get a key:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/  and create/select a project
#   2. Enable the "Maps JavaScript API"
#   3. APIs & Services -> Credentials -> Create credentials -> API key
#   4. (Recommended) Restrict the key to your site under "Application
#      restrictions -> Websites" — e.g. http://localhost:5173/*
#
# This value is loaded into the browser at build time (that is normal for the
# Maps JS API); protect it with the website restriction above rather than by
# hiding it. Never commit your real .env file.

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
